{%- comment -%}
  Outputs "on" when today (shop timezone) is listed in settings.doorbuster_dates
  (comma-separated YYYY-MM-DD). On those days the tier-1 free gift is added to
  ANY order (theme.liquid) and the rewards bar drops the gift node and says so
  (dad-free-shipping-bar). Black Friday + Cyber Monday 2026 door-busters.
  Usage: {% capture dad_db %}{% render 'dad-doorbuster' %}{% endcapture %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign dad_db_today = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
  assign dad_db_dates = settings.doorbuster_dates | default: '' | remove: ' ' | split: ','
  if dad_db_dates contains dad_db_today
    echo 'on'
  endif
-%}
